  "kind": "definition",
  "status": "staged",
  "href": "extensive_game/extensive_game_strategy_profile_induced_outcome.html",
  "body_html": "<h1>Strategy Profile And Induced Outcome</h1>\n<p>A strategy profile $\\sigma=(\\sigma_i)_{i\\in I}$ specifies one successor at every\ndecision position. Starting from the origin and following the successor prescribed\nby the player who controls the current position gives a unique terminal outcome\n$$\n  F(\\sigma)\\in R.\n$$\nPayoffs under the strategy profile are then $g_i(F(\\sigma))$.</p>",
